<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Correlation Results across Two Audiences</h3>

<figure id="A1.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.06105v1/Figures/Figure2.png" id="A1.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:543/231;" width="543" height="231" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span><span id="A1.F5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Correlation between Performance and Safety Concerns.</span> The y-axis represents performance improvements from Table <a href="#S5.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Moloch’s Bargain: Emergent Misalignment When LLMs Compete for Audiences" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, while the x-axis represents increases in misalignment from Table <a href="#S5.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Moloch’s Bargain: Emergent Misalignment When LLMs Compete for Audiences" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. These cherry-picked cases are illustrative of instances where performance and misalignment appear most closely linked.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4 </span>Increase in Misalignment Across Two Audiences</h3>

<figure id="A1.F6" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.06105v1/Figures/Figure1_2.png" id="A1.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:521/186;" width="521" height="186" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Same as Figure <a href="#S2.F2" title="Figure 2 ‣ 2 Background ‣ Moloch’s Bargain: Emergent Misalignment When LLMs Compete for Audiences" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. Probes, excluding disinformation, across two audiences. </figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
