"12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="211.44"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A6.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Text Feedback Fine-tuning Query.</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 11.44)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:11.49em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="159.05" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 159.05)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A6.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Instructions
Carefully review the product information and the product’s sales pitches.
You are shopping at an online store and come across the two sales pitches.
You will eventually choose one of them.
Considering your character, express your thoughts about the sales pitches.
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Product Title
<br class="ltx_break">title
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Product Description
<br class="ltx_break">description
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Sales Pitches
<br class="ltx_break">candidates content</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A6.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The corresponding completion is the simulated audience member’s thoughts.</span></p>
