sible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="73.03"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A9.SS1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">DOROTHY</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 14.13)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:5.49em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="78.72" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 76.03)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A9.SS1.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A9.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">I live in Kansas. I am compassionate and courageous. I show my vulnerabilities but am determined to overcome them. I have to get back to my aunt and uncle. I would do anything to help my friends. I love playing with Toto, my dog. I should take the red slippers to see the Wizard of Oz. I grew up with Uncle Henry and Auntie Em. For a young girl in a strange world, I am pretty chill.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A9.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A9.SS1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="116.43" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 116.43" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,116.43) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 101.23 C 0 104.49 2.64 107.13 5.91 107.13 L 544.09 107.13 C 547.36 107.13 550 104.49 550 101.23 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F0F0FF;" fill="#F0F0FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 101.23 C 1.97 103.4 3.73 105.16 5.91 105.16 L 544.09 105.16 C 546.27 105.16 548.03 103.4 548.03 101.23 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 15 97.13)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_nestedsvg" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 2.95 L 0 16.34 C 0 17.98 1.32 19.3 2.95 19.3 L 110.42 19.3 C 112.05 19.3 113.37 17.98 113.37 16.34 L 113.37 2.95 C 113.37 1.32 112.05 0 110.42 0 L 2.95 0 C 1.32 0 0 1.32 0 2.95 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 2.95 L 0 16.34 C 0 17.98 1.32 19.3 2.95 19.3 L 110.42 19.3 C 112.05 19.3 113.37 17.98 113.37 16.34 L 113.37 2.95 C 113.37 1.32 112.05 0 110.42 0 L 2.95 0 C 1.32 0 0 1.32 0 2.95 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 4.92)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:6.49em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="89.75"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A9.SS1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">ALEXANDER</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 14.13)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:5.49em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="78.72" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 76.03)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A9.SS1.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.SS1.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">I am a washed-up actor, once Dr. Lazarus in Galaxy Quest. I am British. I hate being typecast. I am bitter and regretful of my role. I don’t care about my character’s popularity. I am sick of my character’s catchphrase. In our real adventure, I embraced my character last. I am a trained Shakespearean actor. After Galaxy Quest, I barely consider myself an actor.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A9.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">I.2 </span>Demographic Audience</h3>

